{title: DIA NIARAKA ISIKA}
{artist: LEVELO}
{key: LAb}
{singers: Toky, Ketaka}
{musicians: Haja=Guitare}
{youtube: mTRlEcbaQgE}

Dia niaraka isika
hanadino ny andro maraina
Fitiavako andriko
tsy ho zaka bataina
Ny jiron’ny foko
mitsilopilopy
Nandraisako anao izy iny e,
fafazana toky a

Raha tsy nisy anao tonga haolo
tsy satry ny trano
Ny rano sotroina avy
no mila hanamamo
Fa mamiko loatra ny horokoroka
hampandry ny saina
Ny sangin’ny hariva
hotohizantsika maraina
Ianao ampango
ilay manitra tsy foiko,
Mamelombelona ny aina
Manohantohan-tsy ho lavo
rasombiniaina [×2]

